# Aliyun Drive refresh token (optional but convenient)
#
# How to get it:
#   1. Open https://www.aliyundrive.com (or https://www.alipan.com) in browser and log in
#   2. Press F12 -> Console
#   3. Paste and run: JSON.parse(localStorage.token).refresh_token
#   4. Copy the returned string and paste it below
#
# If you leave this empty, the harness will try:
#   - existing aligo cache (~/.aligo/*.json)
#   - interactive QR-code login (run "python harness/get_token.py" first time)
#
ALIYUN_REFRESH_TOKEN=
